msgstr "Avís ja enviat"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Alerts already sent"
msgstr "Avisos ja enviats"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the order has no on-chain escrow"
msgstr "l'ordre no té dipòsit on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the on-chain escrow is not confirmed and unspent (status: %(status)s)"
msgstr "el dipòsit on-chain no està confirmat i sense gastar (estat: %(status)s)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the %(role)s's bond is not in the escrow"
msgstr "la fiança del %(role)s no és al dipòsit"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the bonds of the escrow cannot be read"
msgstr "no es poden llegir les fiances del dipòsit"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the buyer has not given an on-chain address to receive the sats"
msgstr "el comprador no ha donat cap adreça on-chain per rebre els sats"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the seller has not given an on-chain refund address"
msgstr "el venedor no ha donat cap adreça on-chain de devolució"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "It goes out on chain through the seller's leaf with the coordinator: the seller's app (%(nick)s) must sign the return, then the coordinator adds its signature and broadcasts it. The buyer does not sign anything."
msgstr "Surt a la cadena per la fulla del venedor amb el coordinador: l'app del venedor (%(nick)s) ha de signar la devolució; després el coordinador hi afegeix la seva signatura i l'emet. El comprador no signa res."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "It goes out on chain through the buyer's leaf with the coordinator: the buyer's app (%(nick)s) must sign the release, then the coordinator adds its signature and broadcasts it. The seller does not sign anything."
msgstr "Surt a la cadena per la fulla del comprador amb el coordinador: l'app del comprador (%(nick)s) ha de signar l'alliberament; després el coordinador hi afegeix la seva signatura i l'emet. El venedor no signa res."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "It goes out on chain through the seller's leaf with the coordinator: the seller's app (%(nick)s) must sign the release, then the coordinator adds its signature and broadcasts it. The buyer does not sign anything."
msgstr "Surt a la cadena per la fulla del venedor amb el coordinador: l'app del venedor (%(nick)s) ha de signar l'alliberament; després el coordinador hi afegeix la seva signatura i l'emet. El comprador no signa res."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "trade amount"
msgstr "import de l'intercanvi"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their escrow back"
msgstr "el seu dipòsit de tornada"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "reward from the other bond"
msgstr "recompensa de l'altra fiança"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "leftover of their deposit"
msgstr "sobrant de la seva aportació"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s %(nick)s receives %(sats)s sats at %(address)s (%(parts)s), minus the release's mining fee, which comes out of this output."
msgstr "El %(role)s %(nick)s rep %(sats)s sats a %(address)s (%(parts)s), menys la comissió de mineria de l'alliberament, que surt d'aquesta sortida."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s %(nick)s only gets back the leftover of their deposit, %(sats)s sats at %(address)s."
msgstr "El %(role)s %(nick)s només recupera el sobrant de la seva aportació, %(sats)s sats a %(address)s."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator receives %(sats)s sats at its fee address: %(penalty)s kept from the loser's bond + %(fees)s of trade fees."
msgstr "El coordinador rep %(sats)s sats a la seva adreça de comissions: %(penalty)s retinguts de la fiança del perdedor + %(fees)s de comissions de l'intercanvi."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The development fund receives %(sats)s sats."
msgstr "El fons de desenvolupament rep %(sats)s sats."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s %(nick)s loses their on-chain bond (%(bond)s sats)."
msgstr "El %(role)s %(nick)s perd la seva fiança on-chain (%(bond)s sats)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator receives nothing on chain."
msgstr "El coordinador no rep res a la cadena."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s's bond is a Lightning bond (%(sats)s sats), settled when the dispute opened: the coordinator keeps it and credits %(reward)s sats of it to the %(winner)s as a reward, withdrawn from the app."
msgstr "La fiança del %(role)s és una fiança Lightning (%(sats)s sats), liquidada quan es va obrir la disputa: el coordinador se la queda i n'abona %(reward)s sats al %(winner)s com a recompensa, que es retira des de l'app."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s's Lightning bond (%(sats)s sats), settled when the dispute opened, is credited back to them as a reward, withdrawn from the app."
msgstr "La fiança Lightning del %(role)s (%(sats)s sats), liquidada quan es va obrir la disputa, se li torna com a recompensa, que es retira des de l'app."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their fee"
msgstr "la seva comissió"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The seller %(nick)s gets back %(sats)s sats at %(address)s (%(parts)s), minus the mining fee of the return, which comes out of this output."
msgstr "El venedor %(nick)s recupera %(sats)s sats a %(address)s (%(parts)s), menys la comissió de mineria de la devolució, que surt d'aquesta sortida."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(nick)s gets back %(sats)s sats at %(address)s (%(parts)s)."
msgstr "El comprador %(nick)s recupera %(sats)s sats a %(address)s (%(parts)s)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer's part (%(sats)s sats) is below the dust limit of their address: it cannot be an output of its own and goes with the seller's."
msgstr "La part del comprador (%(sats)s sats) és per sota del límit de pols de la seva adreça: no pot ser una sortida pròpia i va amb la del venedor."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator charges nothing: the trade fees are given back."
msgstr "El coordinador no cobra res: es tornen les comissions de l'intercanvi."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator keeps only the fee already paid in the deposit (%(sats)s sats)."
msgstr "El coordinador només es queda la comissió ja pagada al dipòsit (%(sats)s sats)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The taker's Lightning bond (%(sats)s sats) goes back to them: credited as a reward if it was already settled when the dispute opened, unlocked otherwise."
msgstr "La fiança Lightning del prenedor (%(sats)s sats) se li torna: abonada com a recompensa si ja es va liquidar quan es va obrir la disputa, desbloquejada si no."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "not possible with an on-chain escrow: to pay the buyer use “Buyer wins”"
msgstr "no és possible amb un dipòsit on-chain: per pagar al comprador fes servir «Guanya el comprador»"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "not possible with an on-chain escrow: it can only go to the buyer, to the seller, or back to each party"
msgstr "no és possible amb un dipòsit on-chain: només pot anar al comprador, al venedor o tornar a cada part"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the release cannot be planned: %(error)s"
msgstr "no es pot preparar l'alliberament: %(error)s"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "A cooperative release had already been prepared (never broadcast): this decision replaces it."
msgstr "Ja s'havia preparat un alliberament cooperatiu (mai emès): aquesta decisió el substitueix."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The maker's bond is on chain (%(bond)s sats, behind a Lightning stand-in). What the maker gets back is credited as a Lightning reward."
msgstr "La fiança del creador és a la cadena (%(bond)s sats, darrere d'un substitut Lightning). El que el creador recuperi se li abona com a recompensa Lightning."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s signed and the coordinator broadcast the release."
msgstr "El %(role)s ha signat i el coordinador ha emès l'alliberament."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Waiting for the %(role)s's signature (%(nick)s): their app signs the release when they open the order. The coordinator then adds its signature and broadcasts it; nothing else is needed from you."
msgstr "Esperant la signatura del %(role)s (%(nick)s): la seva app signa l'alliberament quan obre l'ordre. Després el coordinador hi afegeix la seva signatura i l'emet; no cal res més per part teva."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "bond return"
msgstr "devolució de fiança"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "buyer payout"
msgstr "cobrament del comprador"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "seller refund"
msgstr "devolució al venedor"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "buyer funding"
msgstr "aportació del comprador"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "seller funding"
msgstr "aportació del venedor"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "coordinator"
msgstr "coordinador"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "its deposit change comes back here"
msgstr "el canvi de la seva aportació torna aquí"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Deposit payment"
msgstr "Pagament d'aportació"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Deposit outputs"
msgstr "Sortides del dipòsit"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Release outputs"
msgstr "Sortides de l'alliberament"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "extra plan"
msgstr "pla de sobrants"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "dev fund"
msgstr "fons de desenvolupament"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Trader address"
msgstr "Adreça del trader"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "On-chain resolution"
msgstr "Resolució on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The seller %(nick)s gets back %(sats)s sats at %(address)s (%(parts)s)."
msgstr "El venedor %(nick)s recupera %(sats)s sats a %(address)s (%(parts)s)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator receives %(sats)s sats at its fee address: the penalized bond less the reward share."
msgstr "El coordinador rep %(sats)s sats a la seva adreça de comissions: la fiança penalitzada menys la part de recompensa."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The release's mining fee comes out of the coordinator's output."
msgstr "La comissió de mineria de l'alliberament surt de la sortida del coordinador."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The release's mining fee comes out of the seller's output."
msgstr "La comissió de mineria de l'alliberament surt de la sortida del venedor."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "There is no trade: the trade fees are given back and nobody receives sats they did not pay for."
msgstr "No hi ha intercanvi: es tornen les comissions de l'intercanvi i ningú rep sats que no va pagar."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(nick)s receives %(sats)s sats at %(address)s (%(parts)s), minus the release's mining fee, which comes out of this output."
msgstr "El comprador %(nick)s rep %(sats)s sats a %(address)s (%(parts)s), menys la comissió de mineria de l'alliberament, que surt d'aquesta sortida."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator receives %(sats)s sats at its fee address: the trade fees."
msgstr "El coordinador rep %(sats)s sats a la seva adreça de comissions: les comissions de l'intercanvi."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The order ends as a successful trade once the release is broadcast."
msgstr "L'ordre acaba com a intercanvi completat quan s'emeti l'alliberament."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "unknown decision"
msgstr "decisió desconeguda"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "%(sats)s for %(spam)s Spamsats"
msgstr "%(sats)s per %(spam)s Spamsats"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "%(sats)s for %(total)s %(currency)s"
msgstr "%(sats)s per %(total)s %(currency)s"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The node refused the transaction (%(reason)s)."
msgstr "El node ha rebutjat la transacció (%(reason)s)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "won the dispute: the trade amount (their on-chain bond went back on chain)"
msgstr "va guanyar la disputa: l'import de l'operació (la seva fiança en cadena va tornar en cadena)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The maker's bond is on chain (%(bond)s sats, behind a Lightning stand-in). It was already penalized on chain before the decision: the coordinator got %(got)s sats from it and the rest went to the miners. If the maker keeps their bond, its value is credited as a Lightning reward."
msgstr "La fiança del creador és en cadena (%(bond)s sats, darrere un substitut Lightning). Ja es va penalitzar en cadena abans de la decisió: el coordinador en va rebre %(got)s sats i la resta va anar als miners. Si el creador conserva la fiança, se li abona el seu valor com a recompensa Lightning."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The maker's bond is on chain (%(bond)s sats) and still locked: it was not penalized when the dispute opened. If the maker keeps it, it goes straight back to them on chain; if they lose it, it is penalized on chain when you decide. If no decision is made within %(blocks)s blocks, it is penalized anyway before the maker could take it back alone."
msgstr "La fiança del creador és en cadena (%(bond)s sats) i continua bloquejada: no es va penalitzar en obrir-se la disputa. Si el creador la conserva, li torna directament en cadena; si la perd, es penalitza en cadena quan decideixis. Si no hi ha decisió en %(blocks)s blocs, es penalitza igualment abans que el creador la pugui recuperar pel seu compte."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(buyer)s is credited %(trade)s sats as a reward (the trade amount). Their on-chain bond (%(buyer_bond)s) is not credited: it goes straight back to them on chain."
msgstr "Al comprador %(buyer)s se li abonen %(trade)s sats com a recompensa (l'import de l'operació). La seva fiança en cadena (%(buyer_bond)s) no s'abona: li torna directament en cadena."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(buyer)s gets nothing: their on-chain bond (%(buyer_bond)s) is penalized on chain now."
msgstr "El comprador %(buyer)s no rep res: la seva fiança en cadena (%(buyer_bond)s) es penalitza en cadena ara."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Each party gets back what they put in: the buyer %(buyer)s their on-chain bond (%(buyer_bond)s), straight back on chain; the seller %(seller)s their bond (%(seller_bond)s) and their escrow (%(escrow)s), credited as a reward to withdraw from the app."
msgstr "Cada part recupera el que va posar: el comprador %(buyer)s la seva fiança en cadena (%(buyer_bond)s), directament en cadena; el venedor %(seller)s la seva fiança (%(seller_bond)s) i el seu dipòsit (%(escrow)s), abonats com a recompensa per retirar des de l'app."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(buyer)s gets their on-chain bond (%(buyer_bond)s) straight back on chain. They do not receive the trade sats."
msgstr "El comprador %(buyer)s recupera la seva fiança en cadena (%(buyer_bond)s) directament en cadena. No rep els sats de l'operació."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(buyer)s LOSES their on-chain bond (%(buyer_bond)s): it is penalized on chain now and the coordinator keeps it."
msgstr "El comprador %(buyer)s PERD la seva fiança en cadena (%(buyer_bond)s): es penalitza en cadena ara i se la queda el coordinador."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Both bonds go back: the buyer's on-chain bond (%(buyer_bond)s) straight back on chain, and %(seller_bond)s credited to the seller %(seller)s as a reward."
msgstr "Les dues fiances tornen: la fiança en cadena del comprador (%(buyer_bond)s) directament en cadena, i %(seller_bond)s abonats al venedor %(seller)s com a recompensa."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Order %(id)s: the %(role)s's on-chain bond was penalized before the dispute was decided: only %(h)s blocks were left before they could take it back alone"
msgstr "Ordre %(id)s: la fiança en cadena del %(role)s es va penalitzar abans de decidir la disputa: només quedaven %(h)s blocs perquè la pogués recuperar pel seu compte"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Order %(id)s: the %(role)s took their on-chain bond back alone after its timelock, during the dispute"
msgstr "Ordre %(id)s: el %(role)s va recuperar la seva fiança en cadena pel seu compte després del bloqueig temporal, durant la disputa"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Order %(id)s: %(sats)s sats were sent to the %(role)s's on-chain address on the WRONG chain (Spamcoin, SHA-256); the robot was told how to take them back"
msgstr "Ordre %(id)s: s'han enviat %(sats)s sats a l'adreça on-chain del %(role)s per la cadena EQUIVOCADA (Spamcoin, SHA-256); s'ha explicat al robot com recuperar-los"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Hybrid C (on-chain buyer bond)"
msgstr "Mixta C (fiança on-chain del comprador)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Hybrid D (on-chain seller)"
msgstr "Mixta D (venedor on-chain)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "attached after the statement, %(time)s"
msgstr "adjuntat després de la declaració, %(time)s"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Chat attached to a dispute after the statement"
msgstr "Xat adjuntat a una disputa després de la declaració"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Order %(id)s: the %(who)s attached their chat to the dispute (%(n)s messages)"
msgstr "Ordre %(id)s: el %(who)s ha adjuntat el seu xat a la disputa (%(n)s missatges)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their Lightning bond (%(sats)s), credited as a Lightning reward"
msgstr "la seva fiança Lightning (%(sats)s), abonada com a recompensa Lightning"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their on-chain bond (%(sats)s), straight back to them on chain (not credited)"
msgstr "la seva fiança on-chain (%(sats)s), que li torna directament on-chain (no s'abona)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the value of their on-chain bond (%(sats)s), penalized on chain earlier, credited as a Lightning reward"
msgstr "el valor de la seva fiança on-chain (%(sats)s), penalitzada on-chain abans, abonat com a recompensa Lightning"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their on-chain bond (%(sats)s), already back with them on chain"
msgstr "la seva fiança on-chain (%(sats)s), que ja li va tornar on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their Lightning bond (%(sats)s), kept by the coordinator"
msgstr "la seva fiança Lightning (%(sats)s), que es queda el coordinador"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their on-chain bond (%(sats)s), penalized on chain now"
msgstr "la seva fiança on-chain (%(sats)s), penalitzada on-chain ara"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their on-chain bond (%(sats)s), already penalized on chain"
msgstr "la seva fiança on-chain (%(sats)s), ja penalitzada on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their on-chain bond (%(sats)s), which had already gone back to them on chain: nothing to penalize"
msgstr "la seva fiança on-chain (%(sats)s), que ja li havia tornat on-chain: no hi ha res a penalitzar"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s %(nick)s gets: %(parts)s."
msgstr "El %(role)s %(nick)s rep: %(parts)s."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "In total %(total)s sats credited as a Lightning reward, withdrawn from the app."
msgstr "En total, %(total)s sats abonats com a recompensa Lightning, que retira des de l'app."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "the trade amount %(trade)s from the Lightning escrow, credited as a Lightning reward"
msgstr "l'import de l'operació, %(trade)s de l'escrow Lightning, abonat com a recompensa Lightning"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The seller %(seller)s gets nothing back: they lose %(bond)s and their Lightning escrow (%(escrow)s)."
msgstr "El venedor %(seller)s no recupera res: perd %(bond)s i el seu escrow Lightning (%(escrow)s)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their Lightning escrow back (%(escrow)s), credited as a Lightning reward"
msgstr "el seu escrow Lightning de tornada (%(escrow)s), abonat com a recompensa Lightning"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(buyer)s gets nothing: they lose %(bond)s."
msgstr "El comprador %(buyer)s no rep res: perd %(bond)s."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The seller %(seller)s gets %(escrow_text)s, but LOSES %(bond)s."
msgstr "El venedor %(seller)s rep %(escrow_text)s, però PERD %(bond)s."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "They do not receive the trade sats."
msgstr "No rep els sats de l'operació."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(buyer)s LOSES %(bond)s."
msgstr "El comprador %(buyer)s PERD %(bond)s."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(buyer)s is paid %(trade)s sats on chain, to the address they gave (from the Lightning escrow, through the coordinator's swap)."
msgstr "Al comprador %(buyer)s se li paguen %(trade)s sats on-chain, a l'adreça que va donar (de l'escrow Lightning, mitjançant el swap del coordinador)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "trade amount (on-chain escrow)"
msgstr "import de l'operació (escrow on-chain)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their on-chain escrow back"
msgstr "el seu escrow on-chain de tornada"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "their on-chain bond"
msgstr "la seva fiança on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "reward from the other on-chain bond"
msgstr "recompensa de l'altra fiança on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s %(nick)s receives %(sats)s sats on chain at %(address)s (%(parts)s), minus the release's mining fee, which comes out of this output."
msgstr "El %(role)s %(nick)s rep %(sats)s sats on-chain a %(address)s (%(parts)s), menys la comissió de mineria de l'alliberament, que surt d'aquesta sortida."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s %(nick)s only gets back the leftover of their deposit, %(sats)s sats on chain at %(address)s."
msgstr "El %(role)s %(nick)s només recupera el sobrant de la seva aportació, %(sats)s sats on-chain a %(address)s."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator receives %(sats)s sats on chain at its fee address: %(penalty)s kept from the loser's bond + %(fees)s of trade fees."
msgstr "El coordinador rep %(sats)s sats on-chain a la seva adreça de comissions: %(penalty)s retinguts de la fiança del perdedor + %(fees)s de comissions de l'operació."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s's bond is a Lightning bond (%(sats)s sats), settled when the dispute opened: the coordinator keeps it and credits %(reward)s sats of it to the %(winner)s as a Lightning reward, withdrawn from the app."
msgstr "La fiança del %(role)s és Lightning (%(sats)s sats), cobrada en obrir-se la disputa: el coordinador se la queda i n'abona %(reward)s sats al %(winner)s com a recompensa Lightning, que retira des de l'app."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(role)s's Lightning bond (%(sats)s sats), settled when the dispute opened, is credited back to them as a Lightning reward, withdrawn from the app."
msgstr "La fiança Lightning del %(role)s (%(sats)s sats), cobrada en obrir-se la disputa, se li torna abonada com a recompensa Lightning, que retira des de l'app."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The seller %(nick)s gets back %(sats)s sats on chain at %(address)s (%(parts)s), minus the mining fee of the return, which comes out of this output."
msgstr "El venedor %(nick)s recupera %(sats)s sats on-chain a %(address)s (%(parts)s), menys la comissió de mineria de la devolució, que surt d'aquesta sortida."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(nick)s gets back %(sats)s sats on chain at %(address)s (%(parts)s)."
msgstr "El comprador %(nick)s recupera %(sats)s sats on-chain a %(address)s (%(parts)s)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The %(side)s's Lightning bond (%(sats)s sats) goes back to them: credited as a Lightning reward if it was already settled when the dispute opened, unlocked otherwise."
msgstr "La fiança Lightning del %(side)s (%(sats)s sats) li torna: abonada com a recompensa Lightning si ja es va cobrar en obrir-se la disputa; desbloquejada si no."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The seller %(nick)s gets back %(sats)s sats on chain at %(address)s (%(parts)s)."
msgstr "El venedor %(nick)s recupera %(sats)s sats on-chain a %(address)s (%(parts)s)."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator receives %(sats)s sats on chain at its fee address: the penalized bond less the reward share."
msgstr "El coordinador rep %(sats)s sats on-chain a la seva adreça de comissions: la fiança penalitzada menys la part de recompensa."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer %(nick)s receives %(sats)s sats on chain at %(address)s (%(parts)s), minus the release's mining fee, which comes out of this output."
msgstr "El comprador %(nick)s rep %(sats)s sats on-chain a %(address)s (%(parts)s), menys la comissió de mineria de l'alliberament, que surt d'aquesta sortida."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The coordinator receives %(sats)s sats on chain at its fee address: the trade fees."
msgstr "El coordinador rep %(sats)s sats on-chain a la seva adreça de comissions: les comissions de l'operació."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "%(sats)s sats from the %(loser)s's lost bond (the winner's share), credited as a Lightning reward"
msgstr "%(sats)s sats de la fiança perduda del %(loser)s (la part del guanyador), abonats com a recompensa Lightning"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "(%(sats)s sats of that bond go to the %(winner)s as the winner's share)"
msgstr "(%(sats)s sats d'aquesta fiança van al %(winner)s com a part del guanyador)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "on chain"
msgstr "on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "missing"
msgstr "falta"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "held by the coordinator (settled)"
msgstr "en mans del coordinador (liquidada)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "locked (hold invoice)"
msgstr "bloquejada (factura retinguda)"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "returned to its owner"
msgstr "retornada al seu propietari"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "not paid yet"
msgstr "encara sense pagar"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "confirmed, waiting for its owner's signature"
msgstr "confirmada, esperant la signatura del seu propietari"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "locked on chain"
msgstr "bloquejada on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "inside the on-chain escrow"
msgstr "dins del dipòsit on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "penalized on chain"
msgstr "penalitzada on-chain"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "free, back to its owner"
msgstr "lliure, torna al seu propietari"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "back with its owner"
msgstr "de tornada amb el seu propietari"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Buyer's statement"
msgstr "Declaració del comprador"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Seller's statement"
msgstr "Declaració del venedor"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Fiat marked as sent"
msgstr "Fiat marcat com a enviat"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "This dispute is already decided."
msgstr "Aquesta disputa ja està decidida."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Both statements are in: read them and decide below."
msgstr "Ja hi són les dues declaracions: llegeix-les i decideix a sota."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Waiting for the %(role)s's statement; you can already write to both."
msgstr "Falta la declaració del %(role)s; ja pots escriure a tots dos."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Waiting for both statements; you can already write to both."
msgstr "Falten les dues declaracions; ja pots escriure a tots dos."

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "At a glance"
msgstr "D'un cop d'ull"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "At stake"
msgstr "En joc"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "Capa"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Where it is now"
msgstr "On és ara"
